.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt UMOUNT 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm umount
.Nd remove a file: mount
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar path
.Nm
.Fl -selftest
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
asks
.Xr vfsd 8
to remove the mount at the absolute
.Ar path .
The path is normalized; an unknown mount point returns
.Er ENOENT .
.Pp
.Fl -selftest
mounts
.Ql ramfs:
at
.Pa /mnt2 ,
unmounts it, and prints
.Dq umount: selftest ok .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
A rejected unmount exits with status 1.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mount 8 ,
.Xr vfsd 8
.Sh STANDARDS
The mount table is a RavenBSD protocol-version-1 interface.
